  "description": {
   "value": "<p><em>Cursed Corpse Creation — Innate Technique (6th level)</em></p><p>Starting at 6th level, your strong cursed energy has caused mutations to form. When you complete a cursed corpse, you roll a d20. On a roll of 20, your cursed corpse gains a random mutation.</p>\n<h2><strong>D12 Roll</strong>   | <strong>Mutation</strong>         | <strong>Effect</strong></h2>\n<p>1          | Quick Movement   | Gains +20 ft bonus to walking speed.<br />\n2          | Adaptive Movement| Gains 30 ft climb or swim speed.<br />\n3          | Skills           | Prof in 2 skills or 1 saving throw.<br />\n4          | Hardened Frame   | Gains +3 bonus to AC.<br />\n5          | Weapon Usage     | Can wield weapons proficiently.<br />\n6          | Toughness        | Max HP increases by 2 x your level.<br />\n7          | Energy Capacity  | One core can hold +30 additional CE.<br />\n8          | Energy Usage     | Can use Basic CE Manipulation.<br />\n9          | Improved Ability | Gains +4 to an Ability and Max.<br />\n10         | Autonomy         | Doesn’t require commands (sentient).<br />\n11         | Core Capacity    | Can hold 1d4 additional cores.<br />\n12         | Self Generation  | Regains 1 CE per hour.</p>",
   "chat": ""
  },
